# Mimers Brunn v2.0.1 (ACTIVE)

Canonical policy: `docs/architecture/mimers-brunn-v2.0.1.md`.

When changing harvest/import/chunk/approval code:

- Archive-first; PostGIS is a projection only
- No overwrite of version directories; collisions rejected + evidenced
- SHA-256 integrity; paths are operational metadata (not identity)
- Import only with DatasetApprovalArtifact `APPROVED` by HUMAN_OPERATOR or GOVERNANCE_REVIEWER (not harvest producer / SYSTEM_PROCESS / EVOLUTION_AGENT)
- Deterministic byte-offset chunking (max 256 MB, stable order, hash per chunk)
- Lifecycle: HARVESTED → VERIFIED (auto) → APPROVED|REJECTED (governed) → IMPORTED; failures → QUARANTINED
- Runtime mount: `/mnt/geo_master_archive`
